{"ID":"20251106094919-h5v2gf0","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251106094919-h5v2gf0","title":"UPL9-5——减少曲面细分","type":"doc","updated":"20251106140858"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106094919-pzctmm8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20251106094919-pzctmm8","updated":"20251106100349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曲面细分"}]},{"ID":"20251106095126-9cpbzjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095126-9cpbzjl","updated":"20251106095135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在图形渲染中，曲面细分是把一个较粗的网格（低多边形）自动拆分成更多的小三角形，形成更平滑的几何表面"}]},{"ID":"20251106095138-791sgvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095138-791sgvc","updated":"20251106095138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如：\n一张四边形面，可以被细分成 4、16、64 个小面片\n这样视觉上更圆润，但会大幅增加顶点数量和三角形数量"}]},{"ID":"20251106100336-cevu5oh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106100336-cevu5oh","updated":"20251106100349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 534px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251106100337-c4oxsu6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 534px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251106095126-o3pa1o4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095126-o3pa1o4","updated":"20251106095145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般通过曲面细分着色器来实现这样的功能，在对美术表现要求高的游戏中才会使用的技术\n当你有以下这些需求时，才会考虑使用曲面细分着色器"}]},{"ID":"20251106095145-mcns383","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251106095145-mcns383","updated":"20251106095145"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106095145-kuuamro","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251106095145-kuuamro","updated":"20251106095145"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106095145-mdbrn8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095145-mdbrn8q","updated":"20251106095145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高端画质、近景特写"}]}]},{"ID":"20251106095145-unctwvh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251106095145-unctwvh","updated":"20251106095145"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106095145-7u29w41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095145-7u29w41","updated":"20251106095145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"需要真实几何表现而不是靠法线带来的视觉假象"}]}]},{"ID":"20251106095145-y1yjgy7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251106095145-y1yjgy7","updated":"20251106095145"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106095145-tn6vvrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095145-tn6vvrc","updated":"20251106095145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大规模环境"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251106095149-lj7wvoj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251106095149-lj7wvoj","updated":"20251106095215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曲面细分对 GPU 的性能影响"}]},{"ID":"20251106095203-70fylwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095203-70fylwc","updated":"20251106095207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在GPU渲染管线中，曲面细分会增加多种负担"}]},{"ID":"20251106095207-70bana0","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251106095207-70bana0","updated":"20251106095207"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106095207-3napg75","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251106095207-3napg75","updated":"20251106095207"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106095207-q1d08qu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095207-q1d08qu","updated":"20251106095207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"顶点处理压力增加"}]},{"ID":"20251106095208-b0enciw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095208-b0enciw","updated":"20251106095208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每细分一次，顶点数成倍增长\nGPU 顶点着色器、几何阶段需要处理更多数据"}]}]},{"ID":"20251106095207-bu1p72r","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251106095207-bu1p72r","updated":"20251106095207"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106095207-mobozu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095207-mobozu2","updated":"20251106095207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"片元（像素）处理间接增加"}]},{"ID":"20251106095209-0ryblwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095209-0ryblwe","updated":"20251106095209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更多的三角形，意味着更密集的覆盖像素，意味着片元着色器嗲用次数会上升"}]}]},{"ID":"20251106095207-owhjc6u","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251106095207-owhjc6u","updated":"20251106095207"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106095207-lv0bnpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095207-lv0bnpg","updated":"20251106095207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存带宽开销上升"}]},{"ID":"20251106095210-w6d2mq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095210-w6d2mq3","updated":"20251106095210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"顶点数据（坐标、法线、UV、权重等）需要传输，细分越多，显存到 GPU 核心的数据带宽消耗越大"}]}]},{"ID":"20251106095207-pdy83io","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251106095207-pdy83io","updated":"20251106095207"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106095207-0x8sr7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095207-0x8sr7x","updated":"20251106095207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缓存效率下降"}]},{"ID":"20251106095212-uq2kvi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095212-uq2kvi5","updated":"20251106095212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 有顶点缓存、索引缓存，如果三角形过小，缓存命中率降低，导致效率下滑"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251106095203-umkr455","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106095203-umkr455","updated":"20251106095215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此减少曲面细分着色器的使用可以优化性能，可以减少顶点数、三角形数\n可以缓解带宽压力、提高缓存命中率 等\n所以在没有特殊需求时，特别是针对低端设备时，应该尽量避免使用曲面细分着色器"}]}]}